ss=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and February to March came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 30% of normal in March to April and 44% in November to December. So far in 2026, January to February came in at 41% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 10397 had its driest year in 2000 at 61% of normal.</p>"}
